      <!-- Intro Text -->
      <div class="eto-testimonials-intro">
        <h2>ETO Doors has fulfilled thousands of orders for custom doors,</h2>
        <h2>and we are proud to share ETO Doors reviews from satisfied customers all over the United States.</h2>
        
        <p>Welcome to the ETO Doors customer testimonials page. Here you can see how satisfied clients of ours have rated us over the past weeks and months. We always welcome you to create your own testimonials that we can add to our page. Hearing back from experienced customers is just one of the many ways we can continue to see and understand your experience has shaped your relationship with ETO Doors. Please tell us what kind of door or doors you purchased, all about your user experience with our online or telephone staff, and overall how your experience with ETO Doors was. Hearing back from you allows us to continuously improve how we do business with you in the future, as well as how we do business today with other new and existing clients of ours.</p>
        
        <p>When you shop with ETO Doors, we always look forward to hearing all about what you selected, why you selected it, and how our team was able to help you out with picking the interior and/or exterior doors and other entryways you picked out and had delivered to your home. When you work with our superior team of experts, we can help you find the perfect interior and/or exterior doors and entryways for your home or commercial space.</p>
        
        <p>After having fulfilled thousands of orders for countless clients, ETO Doors is proud to show you hundreds of reviews from our customers served all across the U.S. If you are still weighing your options in exterior and interior doors for sale on the Internet, the ETO Doors team invites you to read our humbling reviews as well as to review the selection of doors within our online catalog today. Whether you are looking for something contemporary, ultra-modern, or even bucolic and homey, we have the exterior and interior doors you want in mahogany, Douglas fir, oak, cedar, and many other wood species.</p>
        
        <p>Whether you are looking for single doors, French doors, double doors, or louver doors, and even transoms and sidelites, there's something for everyone at ETO Doors. For those in search of custom-made interior or exterior doors, we invite you to call 1-888-DOORS-ETO to discuss your order with our helpful staff today. If you have already ordered, we would love to hear from you! Please leave us your review below, and thank you for choosing ETO Doors</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Reviews List -->
      <div class="eto-reviews-list">
        {% assign reviews = "Romeo P.|Los Angeles, CA|12/28/2018|I have known Chris and worked with ETO Doors for several years. The quality of their doors and the expert advice I get from Christopher is invaluable. I can honestly say Chris has saved my builds on several occasions. I highly recommend ETO Doors and ask for Chris if you are doing a commercial, residential or hospitality job.|https://s3-media3.fl.yelpcdn.com/photo/wvdkZQU_btoFSjG_f4LHWQ/ls.jpg,Matt K.|Crescenta, CA|12/28/2018|My husband and I recently started the process of remodeling our home, and replacing all of the interior and closet doors was first on our list. We found ETO Doors after seeing a review from Chris Burrows of KTLA news. Our experience with both ETO Doors and especially our sales rep Jessica Rodriguez was amazing. Make no mistake, the company is located in an old building in the middle of nowhere in downtown Los Angeles, and the showroom floor lacks all of the bells and whistles you would find at a Westside boutique, but this is what keeps their prices low and, in my experience, unbeatable. We ended up purchasing custom made solid doors for half the price as we were quoted at other places. The end result is absolutely beautiful, and we could not be happier. Thanks Jessica, and thanks ETO Doors!|https://s3-media4.fl.yelpcdn.com/assets/srv0/yelp_styleguide/7e4e0dfd903f/assets/img/default_avatars/user_large_square.png,Luis M.|Los Angeles, CA|12/24/2018|Greetings, I'm a Door Installation Contractor with Handydoorman.com, I have been buying slab doors and pre-hung doors from ETO doors for years. They have some of the best designs and good prices. Not saying everything has been perfect, but at the end off the day we're all human beings and make mistakes. However, I have had the opportunity to meet the owner Tal, he has been really supportive and welling to help me resolve any issue that had arise throughout the years. I also appreciate the professionalism and support of Esther a sales representative. She is knowledgeable when it comes to any question about doors. I definitely recommended asking for Esther, for your door projects!|https://s3-media2.fl.yelpcdn.com/photo/Hu0ifGft8BjRoC-0xMdzpA/ls.jpg,Katie O.|Hollywood, CA|12/18/2018|We had to buy a couple of doors. Called ETO doors, Christine answered and walked us through everything that was needed. It was an easy and simple process. I will post a photo once they are stained and hung :)|https://s3-media4.fl.yelpcdn.com/photo/sEK-L7shpJVYmqkv1Hbcew/ls.jpg,Jesse T.|Miami, FL|10/23/2018|My mother recently became a home designer. At first, it was easy but then her customers started to request for doors. My mother was lost because she wasn't sure where to get beautiful unique doors. After doing some research, she found ETO doors. She went into the store and found many options of doors. They were able to quickly deliver the orders she placed along with installation. Her customers were very pleased with the outcome. My mothers say thank you!|https://s3-media2.fl.yelpcdn.com/photo/--nMoQ2jJ3E9uv_XX0hbkg/ls.jpg,Ale B.|Miami, FL|9/06/2018|Living in Florida and recently doing a renovation at home, my wife and I were looking for a high impact door. When we searched online and went through a few different providers, we settled on EXMA230. When I placed my order, it took about 2 weeks until I received my order. The door came prepared and packed well. We didn't see any defects or problems with the door during shipping. The sales rep, Tyler was able to help us find the correct measurements. All around it was a good experience with this company, I would use again.|https://s3-media1.fl.yelpcdn.com/photo/gBKyn6BmbY6ego7kFH_25g/ls.jpg,China C.|Los Angeles, CA|5/10/2018|I have had a great experience working with ETO Doors on my latest remodel project. The doors were fairly priced and they arrived to the job site in the time frame that was quoted. I wish they would have been able to finish/stain the doors beforehand but I found someone to do it. I would recommend to contact David in the sales dept for the best service!|https://s3-media2.fl.yelpcdn.com/photo/vUrlTZXQcuTkx4XlXF1wtQ/ls.jpg,Lev S.|Los Angeles, CA|4/16/2018|I have been renovating my home this past year and this is the place to go! Awesome prices and a good selection for doors (interior and exterior), baseboards, door casings, etc. The staff is very helpful and patient! I highly recommend you check them out!!!|https://s3-media1.fl.yelpcdn.com/photo/Snjea3A4q9M7OP8hpIPVcA/ls.jpg,Scott S.|Los Angeles, CA|3/16/2018|ETO Doors is my go to door distributor in the LA area. Weather it's fulfilling the needs of one of my contractors or on a new build or service work they are my go to company. Even with some of the more difficult special order jobs they are more on the spot than other guys around the country especially with time windows. Always have been impressed!|https://s3-media3.fl.yelpcdn.com/photo/MM3NSKR-YewNBINGNwrtDQ/ls.jpg,Sam K.|Los Angeles, CA|12/29/2017|We had bi-fold exterior doors installed - the installation wasn't done properly and I had issues for 12 months. ETO doors came and took a look and fixed the issue - even though they are not in the installation/fixing business. It took a while with their customer service to make it happen, but they finally came out and the assessor guy was fantastically knowledgeable and very good at explaining what went wrong the first time and even fixed the issue. Thanks for making a bad situation good!|https://s3-media4.fl.yelpcdn.com/assets/srv0/yelp_styleguide/7e4e0dfd903f/assets/img/default_avatars/user_large_square.png" | split: "," %}
        
