          </div>
          <div class="eto-review-content">Honestly, I am surprised by all these negative reviews. My experience was so different. I ordered all my doors from Joe. I bought 5 Pre-hung doors. 1 exterior and 4 interior. I was given a lead time of 5 weeks and they arrived on time and with no damage. Joe was so helpful with measuring our rough openings, figuring out the direction of swings and he also giving suggestions on how to finish and seal the doors. Did you know that there are 6 sides to a door? I will order again, when I am ready to remodel the second floor of my house.</div>
