          </div>
          <div class="eto-review-content">I am a novice redoing my house in Solana Beach, CA and wanted to complete the project with a new front door. I originally started with the idea of an iron and glass custom door but the costs come in more that $13,000 before hanging or modification. I needed a cheaper option. After a friend recommended ETO I spoke with a sales agent named Christopher who was not helpful, he basically answered my questions by saying I should "go to my local mill shop and ask for help". Fortunately I came across Esther who was awesome and walked me through everything step by step and got it customized exactly to my liking. This is the place for high end front doors that don't break the bank. Thanks Esther!</div>
