          <div class="eto-review-content">I saw an ad for this company touting their prices so I looked into them. The prices were good. But they should really have stressed their quality and customer service. I was only buying a single French door but they truly treated me right. The door is beautiful vertical grain Douglas fir. I love it. Saved on shipping by picking it up. They loaded it right up and secured it. Could not have asked for more - a custom door in 5 weeks at a great price. I will use them again.</div>
